WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.704
Jack and Mara pushed Roxy into a cell.

2
00:00:07.705 --> 00:00:12.339
Mr. Sweeps smiled. "Now you'll never stop me."

3
00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:16.810
He slammed the heavy iron door.

4
00:00:16.811 --> 00:00:19.114
Roxy heard him lock it.

5
00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:22.441
Roxy thought about the ring Mr. Sweeps was wearing.

6
00:00:22.442 --> 00:00:25.649
"He's using that ring to control everyone.

7
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.096
I need to destroy it."

8
00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:30.880
Roxy looked around the cell.

9
00:00:30.881 --> 00:00:34.278
"I could break down that door," she thought.

10
00:00:34.279 --> 00:00:36.418
"But Mr. Sweeps will hear me.

11
00:00:36.419 --> 00:00:39.827
I need a way to sneak up on him."

12
00:00:39.828 --> 00:00:45.045
Roxy kicked at the rock floor to see how hard it was.

13
00:00:45.046 --> 00:00:48.551
"I think I have an idea."

14
00:00:48.552 --> 00:00:54.484
Mr. Sweeps was examining a diamond when he heard a crash.

15
00:00:54.485 --> 00:00:58.865
"Rocket Girl is trying to break out of her cell," he yelled.

16
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:01.491
"Everyone, guard the door!"

17
00:01:01.492 --> 00:01:05.482
All the students dropped their tools.

18
00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:07.910
They gathered in front of the cell door.

19
00:01:07.911 --> 00:01:11.218
Boom! There was a deep rumbling sound.

20
00:01:11.219 --> 00:01:14.766
The entire cavern shook.

21
00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:19.782
"As soon as Rocket Girl comes out, capture her!" commanded Mr. Sweeps.

22
00:01:19.783 --> 00:01:24.545
Suddenly— kaboom! Pieces of rock flew

23
00:01:24.546 --> 00:01:30.369
everywhere. Roxy blasted through the cavern floor behind

24
00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:34.430
everyone. Mr. Sweeps spun around, but he wasn't fast

25
00:01:34.431 --> 00:01:38.277
enough. Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser

26
00:01:38.278 --> 00:01:40.106
beams. The ring

27
00:01:40.107 --> 00:01:43.675
exploded. "My ring!" cried Mr.

28
00:01:43.676 --> 00:01:48.327
Sweeps. Instantly the students' buttons stopped glowing.

29
00:01:48.328 --> 00:01:51.403
"Where are we?" asked Jack.

30
00:01:51.404 --> 00:01:55.373
"What's going on, Rocket Girl?" asked Mara.

31
00:01:55.374 --> 00:01:59.817
"You were all hypnotized by Mr. Sweeps," answered Roxy.

32
00:01:59.818 --> 00:02:01.779
"He isn't really a principal.

33
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:08.313
He was forcing you to mine diamonds here under the school."

34
00:02:08.314 --> 00:02:12.898
"That's right," said Detective Smith, who had just walked into the cavern.

35
00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:18.796
"And now Sweeps is going to jail!"

36
00:02:18.797 --> 00:02:22.744
In a flash Rocket Girl disappeared.

37
00:02:22.745 --> 00:02:25.187
A moment later Roxy appeared.

38
00:02:25.188 --> 00:02:29.586
She was wearing her regular clothes and her star button.

39
00:02:29.587 --> 00:02:35.468
"What happened?" she mumbled, pretending she'd been hypnotized too.

40
00:02:35.469 --> 00:02:41.216
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

41
00:02:41.217 --> 00:02:45.532
The next morning Principal Penn and the teachers were back at work.

42
00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:49.202
"It looks like things are back to normal," said Mara.

43
00:02:49.203 --> 00:02:51.825
"I'm glad," said Jack.

44
00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:55.446
"I'd rather learn than work in that diamond mine."

45
00:02:55.447 --> 00:02:58.020
"You know what else?" asked Mara.

46
00:02:58.021 --> 00:03:00.715
"We can go to the zoo!

47
00:03:00.716 --> 00:03:05.914
My mom told me our school has money for field trips now."

48
00:03:05.915 --> 00:03:09.627
"Where did the money come from?" Terrell asked.

49
00:03:09.628 --> 00:03:14.267
"Principal Penn is going to sell the diamonds!" said Mara.

50
00:03:14.268 --> 00:03:16.822
"Wow!" said Terrell.

51
00:03:16.823 --> 00:03:20.027
"I told you Rocket Girl can do anything.

52
00:03:20.028 --> 00:03:22.980
She helped our school get money!"

53
00:03:22.981 --> 00:03:28.732
Roxy didn't say a word.

